class_name ChromeText
extends RefCounted

## Engine chrome: every string the Engine itself owns (phases, results, quest
## pools, buttons, UI labels, and every log-line template), in zh/en/ja.
## Distinct from pack text (pack.text.<lang>, required complete by the v1
## contract — no fallback logic there). The en log templates are byte-identical
## to the pre-localization hardcoded strings, so existing replays stay pinned.
##
## The Engine reads this through GameEngine.chrome([lang]) — replays assert
## chrome text at that seam, never through UI internals.

## Locale ids, in the contract's canonical order.
